{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00425","headline":"郊庙歌辞 封泰山乐章 凯安 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 封泰山乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烈祖顺三灵，文宗威四海。\n黄钺诛羣盗，朱旗扫多罪。\n戢兵天下安，约法人心改。\n大哉干羽意，长见风云在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}